## What Problem This Solves

Fixes a lost reply when a new message is steered in while a sequential tool is running and the earlier answer must be sent through `message(action=send)`.

Fixes #176028

## Why This Change Was Made

In `message_tool_only` turns, the runtime lets a final message-tool send to the current source finish before applying a queued steer. Other unstarted tools remain skippable.

## User Impact

Each steered input keeps its own delivered answer in order, matching the queue-steering contract.

